            "body": "[Test failure](https://github.com/neovim/neovim/actions/runs/32842845744/job/97785940054?pr=41475) looks unrelated, rebasing\r\n\r\n<details><summary>Test output</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\nFAILED   .../work/neovim/neovim/test/functional/lua/comment_spec.lua @ 245: commenting toggle_lines() respects tree-sitter injections\r\nExpected values to be equal.\r\nExpected:\r\n\"    -- set background=light\"\r\nActual:\r\n\"    \\\"set background=light\"\r\nstack traceback:\r\n\t.../work/neovim/neovim/test/functional/lua/comment_spec.lua:262: in function 'validate'\r\n\t.../work/neovim/neovim/test/functional/lua/comment_spec.lua:269: in function <.../work/neovim/neovim/test/functional/lua/comment_spec.lua:245>\r\n```\r\n\r\n</details>",
